Package: dcanr
Title: Differential Co-expression Analysis in R
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Description: A unified implementation of three different methods for differential co-expression analysis from the literature: ROS-DET for finding switching pairs, BMHT for ranking differentially co-expressed genes, and BMKC for finding differentially co-expressed modules.
